    "text": "China's City Tournaments (城市赛) give a Simplified Chinese holo Poké Ball as a placement prize in their individual events, in both the Standard and the Open format. Each copy is stamped with its placing: Top 8 for players who finished third to eighth, and 2nd Place and Champion for the runner-up and the winner. The team event has its own card, Pal Pad.",
